<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Republic upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Republic upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Republic Industries Inc's long-term rating to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Republic's near-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Republic gained 3/4 to 40-7/8 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
